  "steps": [
    "In a pan, add 1 tsp oil/butter. Add garlic and onion to this and saute until golden brown. The. Add your bell peppers and saute for 3-4 mins.",
    "Next add the sauces and condiments mentioned above. Mix well and then add soyabean and basil. Add a dash of water and cover it for 3-4 mins (leave on low flame). After this, add the cheese and just cook on medium- high flame for 2 minutes until the sauce dries up a bit.",
    "You can apply butter on 2 slices of bread and serve this (i skipped butter to cut calories)."
